*.md
# Keep project documentation under version control (overrides the *.md rule above)
!readme.md
!readme.ru.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!SECURITY.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!/.github/**/*.md
!/.infra/install-notes.md
# Documentation site (mkdocs) — tracked (overrides *.md above).
# git cannot re-include files under an ignored directory, so docs/ is NOT ignored.
!docs/
!docs/**
!ROADMAP.md
!mkdocs.yml

PRESENTATION.*
.codegraph/

